{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106418","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106418/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106418/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106418/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106418","id":3064472092,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WPBQD","number":106418,"title":"Core: Integrate object nullability binds","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-05-14T23:21:02Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T08:59:42Z","closed_at":"2026-01-21T14:53:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106418","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106418","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106418.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106418.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Implements godotengine/godot-proposals#2241\r\n- Related #86079\r\n- Alternative to #105962\r\n\r\nBecause the prospect of changing the formatting of the entire codebase for supporting a nullable type is daunting, this aims to take a more hands-off approach by adding non-null metadata to bindings exclusively. As such, this is a simple way to introduce the concept of non-nullable objects to gdextension, and a jumping-off point should we choose to introduce a \"proper\" type for the concept in the future.\r\n\r\nThe idea is to constrain this nullability logic to a bind-time annotation; well, the closest approximation to that which can be passed to a cstring. This metadata is only included in the debug builds, as it otherwise isn't relevant for the scope this PR aims for. A new macro, `NOT_NULL`, is prepended to a given function/argument name to directly set the non-null flag.\r\n\r\n---\r\nExample Node bindings:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid Node::_bind_methods() {\r\n\t...\r\n\tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"remove_child\", NOT_NULL \"node\"), &Node::remove_child);\r\n\t...\r\n\tClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(NOT_NULL \"get_node\", \"path\"), &Node::get_node);\r\n\t...\r\n}\r\n```\r\nExample binding output:\r\n```json\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\"name\": \"remove_child\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t...\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\"arguments\": [\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"name\": \"node\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"type\": \"Node\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"meta\": \"notnull\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t]\r\n\t\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t\t\t...\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\"name\": \"get_node\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t...\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\"return_value\": {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"type\": \"Node\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"meta\": \"notnull\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t\t\t\t...\r\n\t\t\t\t},\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106418/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}